sequenceDiagram
    participant JVM as JVM
    participant DemoApplication as DemoApplication
    participant SpringApplication as SpringApplication
    participant SpringBootContext as Spring Boot Context
    participant Autoconfiguration as Autoconfiguration

    Note over JVM,Autoconfiguration: Application Startup - JVM initialization and Spring Boot application context setup

    JVM->>DemoApplication: invoke main method
    Note right of JVM: Entry point of application
    activate DemoApplication

    DemoApplication->>SpringApplication: run(DemoApplication.class, args)
    Note right of DemoApplication: Starts Spring Boot application
    activate SpringApplication

    SpringApplication->>SpringBootContext: initialize application context
    Note right of SpringApplication: Creates ApplicationContext
    activate SpringBootContext

    SpringBootContext->>Autoconfiguration: load autoconfiguration beans
    Note right of SpringBootContext: Loads Configuration classes
    activate Autoconfiguration

    Autoconfiguration-->>SpringBootContext: beans loaded
    Note right of Autoconfiguration: All beans registered in context
    deactivate Autoconfiguration

    SpringBootContext-->>SpringApplication: application ready for requests
    Note right of SpringBootContext: Startup complete
    deactivate SpringBootContext

    SpringApplication-->>DemoApplication: application ready for requests
    deactivate SpringApplication
    deactivate DemoApplication